    },
    {
      "entryId": "ecc-12-14",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Every secret thing, good or evil. First principle: the judgment includes the secret — no classified compartment escapes; Paul and John quote the same audit.",
