    {
      "entryId": "ecc-3-17",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "A time for every purpose — including judgment. First principle: the Preacher's consolation under injustice: the schedule includes a courtroom; every work has its time there.",
